[0m
[32m|----------|------|-------------------|----------------------|---------------|
[0m
[32m| Chesapeake Emerging Opportunities Club (CEOC) | Angel group | $150 k‑$2 M | $1.2 M in **NeuroGen** (AI‑diagnostics, Mar 2025) | Life‑science focus, Maryland‑based |
[0m
[32m| Baltimore Angels | Angel network | $250 k‑$2 M | $1.5 M in **NeuroAge Therapeutics** (AI‑neurology, Jan 2026) | Proximity to Johns Hopkins, health‑tech pipeline |
[0m
[32m| TEDCO Seed Fund | State‑backed seed fund | $100 k‑$500 k (co‑invest) | $400 k in **Balance Theory** (cyber‑security health data, Sep 2025) | Maryland‑principal, early‑stage focus |
[0m
[32m| Maryland Momentum Fund (MMF) | University‑system fund | $150 k‑$250 k (up to $500 k) | $250 k in **CerebroAI** (brain‑imaging AI, Feb 2026) | University‑affiliated, biotech thesis |
